<title>SINGAPORE: Bonvest first half net up 9.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Bonvest first half net up 9.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in million of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   10.93  vs  9.95</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	5.17  vs  4.71</p>
<p>    Turnover		     75.23  vs 66.52</p>
<p>    Other income		  0.61  vs  1.08</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    0.96  vs  0.21</p>
<p>    Pretax			 14.27  vs 13.58</p>
<p>    Tax			     3.35  vs  3.82</p>
<p>    Minorities		    nil   vs  0.19</p>
<p>Note - Property-based Bonvest Holdings Ltd said there was a construction schedule delay of its Shelford Road project which would lead to a slower recognition of profits from the development. It therefore expects profit in the second half to be lower than first half.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080 ds at</p>
